WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.754 --> 00:00:18.195
stared at the broom flying squad in confusion.

2
00:00:18.215 --> 00:00:22.859
"Winnie is one of the best fliers at Monster Academy," he thought.

3
00:00:22.879 --> 00:00:25.821
"So why isn't she with the other fliers?"

4
00:00:27.542 --> 00:00:29.624
Ben hoped she wasn't at home, sick today.

5
00:00:30.644 --> 00:00:35.566
It would be a shame for her to miss such a big day—the humans' first visit to Monster

6
00:00:35.626 --> 00:00:39.548
Academy. Ben and Winnie had been dating for a few weeks.

7
00:00:40.388 --> 00:00:45.411
Their first date was to a horror movie about ghosts who lived in a house haunted by people.

8
00:00:47.392 --> 00:00:51.693
After the movie they got some moldy ice cream and went for a walk in the park.

9
00:00:53.754 --> 00:00:57.036
It had been a lot of fun, and Ben really liked Winnie.

10
00:00:59.372 --> 00:01:02.353
Ben drifted through the lobby until he found Gaby again.

11
00:01:07.155 --> 00:01:09.936
thought Winnie would be with the broom flying squad," he said.

12
00:01:09.956 --> 00:01:11.717
"But she's not with them.

13
00:01:11.777 --> 00:01:17.039
I'm not sure where He let his words trail off as he realized that Gaby's eyes were darting

14
00:01:17.159 --> 00:01:18.140
all over the hallway.

15
00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.681
She wasn't really listening to him.

16
00:01:20.701 --> 00:01:23.462
"Hmm. What did you say?"

17
00:01:23.862 --> 00:01:24.562
Gaby murmured.

18
00:01:24.582 --> 00:01:26.183
"You didn't find Winnie?"

19
00:01:26.563 --> 00:01:28.444
Gaby was still searching the hallway.

20
00:01:29.276 --> 00:01:30.737
"I'm sure she'll show up soon, Ben.

21
00:01:31.638 --> 00:01:32.879
I'm looking for someone too.

22
00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:34.801
Have you seen Deb anywhere?"

23
00:01:34.821 --> 00:01:36.542
"Who's Deb?"

24
00:01:36.782 --> 00:01:37.323
Ben asked.

25
00:01:37.343 --> 00:01:40.145
"A ghoul," said Gaby.

26
00:01:40.165 --> 00:01:45.349
"She just started at Monster Academy last week, and I've heard she's super smart."

27
00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:47.371
"Why are you looking for her?"

28
00:01:47.771 --> 00:01:48.332
asked Ben.

29
00:01:49.112 --> 00:01:49.953
Gaby frowned.

30
00:01:49.973 --> 00:01:55.438
"Someone told me that she offered to help Waldo with his experiment demonstration today.

31
00:01:57.199 --> 00:01:59.701
If you ask me, that's a ridiculous idea.

32
00:02:00.341 --> 00:02:02.622
I mean, Waldo is the smartest kid in school.

33
00:02:03.642 --> 00:02:05.083
He doesn't need any— Oh!

34
00:02:05.383 --> 00:02:06.063
There she is.

35
00:02:06.443 --> 00:02:09.245
Whew!" Gaby let out a big breath of relief.

36
00:02:10.145 --> 00:02:11.365
Ben looked down the hallway.

37
00:02:12.106 --> 00:02:15.887
At the other end, a pretty ghoul girl was getting something out of her locker.

38
00:02:15.907 --> 00:02:20.909
"I guess that was just a rumor about Deb," Gaby said.

39
00:02:20.929 --> 00:02:23.870
"Would it matter if Deb were helping Waldo?"

40
00:02:24.291 --> 00:02:25.011
Ben asked.

41
00:02:25.811 --> 00:02:27.432
Gaby was acting pretty weird.

42
00:02:28.352 --> 00:02:28.832
"Um, no.

43
00:02:29.113 --> 00:02:29.773
Of course not!"

44
00:02:30.093 --> 00:02:31.014
Gaby said quickly.

45
00:02:31.034 --> 00:02:35.876
"But, like I said, Waldo's the smartest student at Monster Academy.

46
00:02:36.636 --> 00:02:38.817
He doesn't need help from some new ghoul girl."

47
00:02:40.258 --> 00:02:44.981
As Gaby went on about how smart Waldo was, Ben turned to hide his smile.

48
00:02:45.961 --> 00:02:48.502
He knew now why Gaby was acting so weird.

49
00:02:48.963 --> 00:02:51.344
She was jealous—jealous of Deb!

50
00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:59.141
Ben started floating through the halls again.

51
00:03:00.481 --> 00:03:01.982
Soon he spotted Mog.

52
00:03:04.023 --> 00:03:04.443
"Hey, Mog!"

53
00:03:04.863 --> 00:03:06.104
Ben called to his friend.

54
00:03:06.124 --> 00:03:07.884
"Have you seen Winnie?"

55
00:03:09.325 --> 00:03:10.285
Mog shook his head.

56
00:03:10.305 --> 00:03:13.046
"No. Have you seen Deb?"

57
00:03:13.066 --> 00:03:15.768
"Deb?" Ben asked.

58
00:03:16.628 --> 00:03:18.889
Why was everybody suddenly looking for Deb?

59
00:03:18.909 --> 00:03:21.290
"Yeah," said Mog.

60
00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:24.171
"She's this awesome new ghoul."

61
00:03:24.191 --> 00:03:27.680
"I know who she is," said Ben.

62
00:03:28.701 --> 00:03:30.141
"She was at her locker a minute ago."

63
00:03:31.001 --> 00:03:32.962
He glanced back at the row of lockers.

64
00:03:32.982 --> 00:03:35.803
"She's gone now, though."

65
00:03:37.523 --> 00:03:38.883
Mog sighed dreamily.

66
00:03:38.903 --> 00:03:42.905
"She's like something out of my nightmares.

67
00:03:43.365 --> 00:03:45.765
And I love nightmares."

68
00:03:47.266 --> 00:03:48.326
Ben was surprised.

69
00:03:48.346 --> 00:03:50.767
"I thought you were dating Lilly."

70
00:03:50.787 --> 00:03:53.307
"Nah," said Mog.

71
00:03:53.327 --> 00:03:55.068
"That was last week.

72
00:03:56.128 --> 00:03:57.969
This week I'm going out with Deb."

73
00:03:59.469 --> 00:04:00.289
Ben shrugged.

74
00:04:00.309 --> 00:04:03.850
"I guess she could be in the science lab," he said.

75
00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:07.651
"Gaby told me that Deb might help Waldo with his experiment today."

76
00:04:08.711 --> 00:04:10.112
Mog raised his eyebrows.

77
00:04:10.132 --> 00:04:14.073
"What do you mean, she 'might help Waldo with his experiment'?

78
00:04:14.733 --> 00:04:16.794
You don't think Waldo likes her, do you?

79
00:04:17.534 --> 00:04:20.135
They're just working together because they have to, right?"

80
00:04:20.155 --> 00:04:25.016
"Whoa." Ben held up a hand to slow Mog down.

81
00:04:26.048 --> 00:04:27.309
"Don't panic or anything.

82
00:04:27.369 --> 00:04:29.590
I'm not even sure they are working together.

83
00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:31.370
It's just a rumor."

84
00:04:32.591 --> 00:04:34.011
Mog still looked worried.

85
00:04:34.031 --> 00:04:36.332
"I'd better talk to Gaby myself.

86
00:04:36.973 --> 00:04:38.793
I want to find out what's going on."

87
00:04:40.034 --> 00:04:42.635
The monster stomped down the hallway toward Gaby.

88
00:04:44.576 --> 00:04:45.616
Ben rolled his eyes.

89
00:04:46.036 --> 00:04:49.037
He couldn't believe everyone was so jealous about Deb.

90
00:04:49.057 --> 00:04:51.559
"Hey, Jen!"

91
00:04:51.959 --> 00:04:53.399
Ben called to a purple blob.

92
00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:54.940
"Hi, Ben!"

93
00:04:55.292 --> 00:04:57.253
said Jen, her body jiggling.

94
00:04:57.273 --> 00:04:59.755
"Isn't it wonderful?"

95
00:04:59.775 --> 00:05:02.176
"The people's visit?"

96
00:05:02.496 --> 00:05:03.197
Ben asked.

97
00:05:03.217 --> 00:05:04.597
"Is that what you mean?"

98
00:05:04.617 --> 00:05:07.499
"Yes," said Jen.

99
00:05:07.519 --> 00:05:09.940
"I can't wait to see Dave again.

100
00:05:11.021 --> 00:05:13.602
I haven't seen him for three whole days!

101
00:05:14.463 --> 00:05:15.543
Do I look all right?"

102
00:05:16.504 --> 00:05:18.905
Ben watched as Jen slowly spun around.

103
00:05:19.846 --> 00:05:22.667
A pool of slime spread out on the floor around her.

104
00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:27.481
"You look great," he said.

105
00:05:27.501 --> 00:05:29.822
"Thanks!" said Jen.

106
00:05:29.842 --> 00:05:32.503
"You haven't seen Winnie, have you?"

107
00:05:32.843 --> 00:05:33.463
asked Ben.

108
00:05:33.483 --> 00:05:38.325
"She's probably with the broom flying squad," said Jen.

109
00:05:38.345 --> 00:05:42.727
"They're planning a big flyover for when the people get here, aren't they?"

110
00:05:44.148 --> 00:05:44.948
Ben sighed.

111
00:05:44.968 --> 00:05:48.129
"Yeah, I thought she would be with them too.

112
00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:51.591
But I saw the squad a minute ago, and she wasn't with them."

113
00:05:52.871 --> 00:05:53.732
Jen shrugged.

114
00:05:55.008 --> 00:05:57.950
"Maybe she was in the bathroom or tuning up her broom.

115
00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:01.271
She might even be—" "Hey, everybody!"

116
00:06:01.832 --> 00:06:03.392
An excited voice cut her off.

117
00:06:03.412 --> 00:06:06.814
"The people are here!"

118
00:06:07.335 --> 00:06:08.195
shouted a goblin.
